flowchart TB
  accTitle: One DorkOS program in three roles, and the seams between them
  accDescr: The accepted direction of ADR 261015-042933 as of 2026-11-21. One server package runs as a person's computer, a hub or an agent computer, and ships the space server as a fourth entry. Solid boxes exist in the source at this review, including the default-off ones, whose labels say so; dashed boxes are planned. Servers connect by pairing. A Mac's chats reach the web through the session relay. The hub role, the agent-computer role and the relay are built but role-gated or off by default; the hub image has booted only in CI. Nothing here is deployment proof.
  legend["ONE PROGRAM, THREE ROLES · built parts solid, planned parts dashed<br/>Role-gated or default-off is not deployed"]
  subgraph computer["Your computer · DORKOS_SERVER_ROLE=computer · shipped"]
    mac["DorkOS server + client<br/>Runtimes: Claude Code · Codex · OpenCode · Doe<br/>Rooms, tasks, heartbeats, audit in SQLite + files"]
    relayMac["Session relay, Mac side<br/>Dials the pinned hub · chats only<br/>Default off until linked"]
    localvm["Sealed computer on a Mac<br/>Lima VM · computer-local runtime<br/>Experiment, default off"]
    mac --> relayMac
    mac -.->|"turns, tool bridge"| localvm
  end
  subgraph hub["Hub · DORKOS_SERVER_ROLE=hub · built, image boots only in CI"]
    hubsrv["Hub mode<br/>No runtimes · owner from Cloud assignment<br/>Login always on · pooled refuses all"]
    priv["Private space<br/>LOCAL_COMMUNITY · locked by structure"]
    relayHub["Hub relay endpoint<br/>/api/relay/computer · viewer-open wake"]
    fwd["Forwarding runtime<br/>Works on: Cloud<br/>Planned · A7"]
    hubsrv --> priv
    hubsrv --> relayHub
    hubsrv -.-> fwd
  end
  subgraph agentpc["Agent computer · DORKOS_SERVER_ROLE=agent-computer · built role, no fleet"]
    sealed["Sealed runtime host<br/>Agent credentials only · loopback bind<br/>OpenCode only · hub-owned writes refused"]
    bridge["Tool calls sent back to the hub<br/>Planned · A7 / A8"]
    sealed -.-> bridge
  end
  subgraph space["Space server · own entry + image target in the same package · shipped"]
    spacesrv["createCommunityApp · own Hono app<br/>Postgres · host-wide sign-in · tenant data<br/>Agents are members · availability reported"]
  end
  cloud["Optional DorkOS Cloud<br/>Hub assignment · computers start/stop · directory<br/>Public cloud-api contracts"]
  relayMac -->|"signed frames · stream, send, approvals, interrupt"| relayHub
  fwd -.->|"relay channel · turn.start, agents.sync"| sealed
  bridge -.->|"tools.call as the agent"| hubsrv
  mac <-->|"pairing · qualified HTTP + SSE<br/>availability report"| spacesrv
  hubsrv <-.->|"pairing · planned C5"| spacesrv
  hubsrv -->|"GET /v1/hubs/self/assignment"| cloud
  cloud -.->|"start / stop · link code<br/>contract only"| sealed
  mac -->|"optional link, credits, managed remote"| cloud
  classDef built fill:#edf3fa,stroke:#46709b,color:#183047
  classDef planned fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#8a9bab,color:#3b4a58,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef hosted fill:#fff5e4,stroke:#a87720,color:#49320c
  class legend,mac,relayMac,localvm,hubsrv,priv,relayHub,sealed,spacesrv built
  class fwd,bridge planned
